gaijin-rv32imac-ilp32-le-bflt4-static-uclibc-v1
RV32 NOMMU; 32-bit pointers/long; little endian; soft-float calling convention.
Hardware F/D instructions and ilp32f/ilp32d binaries are unsupported.
Validated on Tanmatsu rev7 with the pinned RV32IMAC/ilp32 uClibc-ng bFLT toolchain.
ABI validation accepted 2026-10-28; compatibility is limited to this toolchain.
